Directions for Use:
&#xD;
&#xD;
Trim the wick to 1/4" each time before use to reduce sooting. Avoid using it in drafty areas. Burn only on a well-protected heat-resistant surface for a maximum of 3 to 4 hours. Do not allow matches, wick trimmings, or debris to accumulate in the wax pool.&#xD;
If the flame gets too large or smokes, extinguish the candle, cool it, and trim the wick to 1/4".&#xD;
Discontinue use when 1/2" wax remains as glass may shatter.&#xD;
Never move a burning candle as the container will be too hot, do not touch it until cool.&#xD;
Remove packaging before burning and leave at least 10 centimeters between burning candles.&#xD;
Never extinguish a burning candle with water.&#xD;
&#xD;
Warning:&#xA0;Burn within sight. Keep away from things that catch fire. To prevent fire keep out of reach of children and pets.

